WEBVTT

00:04:59.876 --> 00:05:02.236
that starts with climate solutions.

00:05:03.036 --> 00:05:07.036
This momentum is guided
by a zero-emissions,

00:05:07.076 --> 00:05:10.516
climate resilience,
and health equity road map.

00:05:10.516 --> 00:05:13.636
For example, the state
of Chhattisgarh in India

00:05:13.676 --> 00:05:17.356
has solarized over 900
community health centers

00:05:17.396 --> 00:05:20.876
and pledged to attain
100 percent solarization

00:05:20.876 --> 00:05:23.076
to provide energy access,

00:05:23.116 --> 00:05:26.396
thus anchoring the resilience
of the community

00:05:26.396 --> 00:05:28.596
and protecting the most vulnerable.

00:05:29.156 --> 00:05:32.036
Last year, India’s
National Health Service